{
 "title": "Nodstage: one connected workspace (master)",
 "voice": "am_puck",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "lines": [
  [
   "How many apps does it take to run a creative agency?",
   0.35,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Depends. What do you need to do?",
   0.35,
   "af_jessica",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "Find clients. Manage projects. Talk to clients. Get designs approved. Chase payments.",
   0.35,
   "am_puck",
   1.06
  ],
  [
   "So... a lot of apps?",
   0.3,
   "af_jessica",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Way too many.",
   0.45,
   "am_puck",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Your leads are in a CRM. Your projects are in a project management tool. Feedback lives in email or a separate proofing app. Client conversations are somewhere else. And proposals, invoices and payments? More tools.",
   0.35,
   "bm_fable",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "And none of them seem to know what's happening in the others.",
   0.4,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "What if they were all connected?",
   0.45,
   "af_jessica",
   0.97
  ],
  [
   "Meet Nodstage. One connected workspace built around how creative studios actually work.",
   0.4,
   "bm_fable",
   0.98
  ],
  [
   "Start with your leads. Manage inquiries, discovery calls, follow-ups and proposals. When a deal is won, turn it into a project.",
   0.4,
   "bm_fable",
   1.02
  ],
  [
   "Manage projects, tasks, deadlines and your team's workload. Give clients their own branded portal. Share files and proofs, collect visual feedback, manage revisions and get approvals.",
   0.4,
   "bm_fable",
   1.04
  ],
  [
   "Keep conversations and video messages together. Manage your calendar, change orders, invoices and payments. Automate repetitive work, use intake forms and templates, track performance and request testimonials.",
   0.4,
   "bm_fable",
   1.05
  ],
  [
   "So I don't need to keep jumping between all those tools?",
   0.3,
   "am_puck",
   1.0
  ],
  [
   "That's the whole point.",
   0.45,
   "af_jessica",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Less switching. Less chasing. One connected workflow.",
   0.4,
   "bm_fable",
   0.95
  ],
  [
   "Nodstage is coming soon. Join the waitlist for early access.",
   0.3,
   "bm_fable",
   0.97
  ]
 ],
